# The site is plain static files with no build step, so almost everything here
# belongs in the repo. What does not is the output of _tools/, which is either
# regenerated on demand or already pasted into the page it was cut for.
#
# Note this is a different list from .vercelignore, which is about what reaches
# the deploy — the brand sources and the build scripts are committed, they just
# are not served.

# Python
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]

# Build intermediates. build-brand-assets.py writes the contour for pasting
# into mark.html and re-sets TECH as a standing check on the division lockups;
# trace-strands.py writes a proof sheet for a human to choose from. All three
# are re-made by running the tools, and none is read by the site.
_tools/mark-contour.path.txt
_tools/strand-proof.png
img/wordmark-tech.svg

# Editor and OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# Vercel
.vercel/
